; Belisarius bli-team.per — Prompt 10 TEAM GAMES (§45, practical subset).
; No perfect communication: share attack information and join allied attacks
; through the engine's cooperation switches (Naga-proven), track the closest
; enemy for focus (bli-pressure already re-targets as enemies fall). Full
; coordinated-timing and sling play are deferred — flanks/pockets both play
; the same sound contextual game, which is the correct fallback.

(defrule
  (true)
=>
  (set-strategic-number sn-coop-share-attacking 1)
  (set-strategic-number sn-coop-share-attacking-interval 2)
  (set-strategic-number sn-coop-share-information 1)
  (disable-self))
